      "next_step": "Check the health of DNS resolver 10.0.0.2 from the api-gateway hosts, for example by timing `dig auth.idp.example @10.0.0.2`. Also check whether the record for auth.idp.example, or an upstream forwarder, changed around 02:14. My queries gave conflicting answers on start time: a top query for 01:14\u201302:05 showed the same 3s p95, and a log search ending at 02:10 returned a record from 02:29. Confirm in the dashboards when the timeouts began. As a stopgap, consider caching the DNS answer or shortening the resolver timeout in the gateway.",
